{
  "title": "Operate / Pipeline Health",
  "uid": "operate-pipeline-health",
  "description": "Is the log pipeline flowing? Throughput per Loki stream as the ingest proxy, plus a raw-vs-normalized check: if a raw {job=\"<pot>\"} stream flows but its {job=\"events\"} normalized counterpart flatlines, a Vector remap is dropping events or the source checkpoint went stale (ships nothing silently). Disk and Loki-internal metrics need a Prometheus/node-exporter that is not yet deployed — see the note panel; that is Operational-maturity observability work.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
  "timepicker": {},
  "refresh": "1m",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "tags": ["operate", "pipeline", "ingest"],
  "links": [],
  "annotations": {"list": []},
  "templating": {"list": []},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total Lines Ingested",
      "description": "All log lines across every Loki stream in range",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue"},
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "blue", "value": null}]}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
        "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=~\".+\"} [$__range]))",
        "instant": true,
        "queryType": "instant",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Normalized Events",
      "description": "Lines on the {job=\"events\"} contract stream in range",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green"},
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
        "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"events\"} [$__range]))",
        "instant": true,
        "queryType": "instant",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Streams",
      "description": "Distinct job labels that ingested in range",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple"},
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "purple", "value": null}]}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
        "expr": "count(sum by (job) (count_over_time({job=~\".+\"} [$__range])))",
        "instant": true,
        "queryType": "instant",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ingest Last 15m",
      "description": "Lines across all streams in the last 15m — a sustained 0 means the pipeline has stalled",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
        "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=~\".+\"} [15m]))",
        "instant": true,
        "queryType": "instant",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Ingest Rate by Stream",
      "description": "Lines per interval per Loki job. The throughput proxy — every stream that is alive shows here.",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"}
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {"calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
        "expr": "sum by (job) (count_over_time({job=~\".+\"} [$__interval]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
        "queryType": "range",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Normalized Event Rate by Honeypot",
      "description": "Rate on {job=\"events\"} per honeypot. Cross-check against the raw stream above: a raw pot stream flowing while its line here is flat means its Vector remap is dropping everything (broken VRL or stale source checkpoint).",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {"group": "A", "mode": "none"}
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {"calcs": ["max"], "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
        "expr": "sum by (honeypot) (count_over_time({job=\"events\"} [$__interval]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{honeypot}}",
        "queryType": "range",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Lines per Stream in Range",
      "description": "Volume by Loki job — quick read on which streams are carrying load",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"custom": {"align": "left", "displayMode": "auto", "filterable": true}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {"show": false},
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{"desc": true, "displayName": "Lines"}]
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
        "expr": "sum by (job) (count_over_time({job=~\".+\"} [$__range]))",
        "instant": true,
        "queryType": "instant",
        "refId": "A"
      }],
      "transformations": [
        {"id": "organize", "options": {"excludeByName": {"Time": true}, "renameByName": {"job": "Stream (job)", "Value #A": "Lines"}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Pipeline Signals (vector / docker / error)",
      "description": "Recent syslog lines matching vector/docker/oom/error — the host-side view of pipeline trouble",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 22},
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
        "expr": "{job=\"syslog\"} |~ \"(?i)vector|docker|oom|error|fail\"",
        "queryType": "range",
        "refId": "A"
      }]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Not yet covered — needs Prometheus",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 22},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Gaps on this board\n\nThese need a **Prometheus / node-exporter** that the stack does not run yet:\n\n- **Disk usage** per host (Loki retention vs. the 25 GB Nanode — when Loki fills the disk it stops writing and the stack goes unhealthy).\n- **Loki internal metrics** — ingestion rate limiting, rejected/duplicate samples, chunk flush errors.\n- **Vector internal metrics** — buffer pressure, component errors, events-dropped.\n\nUntil then this board approximates throughput from **log volume** and surfaces host-side trouble from **syslog**.\n\nStanding up metrics scraping is **Operational-maturity** observability work (`docs/!VISION.md`)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
